        "date": "2026-11-19T01:41:20Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): a headless start opens the file named on the command line\n\n`camcraft-ui --headless <file>` opened nothing and said nothing about\nthe file. The headless entry now takes the same file list and check as\nthe window (#2462): a refused file is said by name (rc 2), a model or\nproject file is opened through ImportFile/OpenProjectFile in place of\nthe seeded proof document, framed and drawn. A file that does not open\nfails the run by name (rc 1). The last line says what was drawn.\n\nFixes #2648\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MLU9aif5zm7mure23AKftd",
